WEBVTT

00:11:59.036 --> 00:12:01.996
Or if we really just wake up.

00:12:03.196 --> 00:12:06.956
Disrupt the status quo
and pay real attention,

00:12:06.956 --> 00:12:09.916
real, respectful attention
to these leaders,

00:12:09.916 --> 00:12:12.836
who are on the ground,

00:12:12.876 --> 00:12:15.156
implementing and creating solutions

00:12:15.156 --> 00:12:18.596
that are leading us
out of the climate crisis right now,

00:12:18.636 --> 00:12:19.756
day by day.

00:12:20.396 --> 00:12:22.076
There's no time to waste.

00:12:23.316 --> 00:12:24.476
Thank you.